  "worked_solution": "The eigenvector $u=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ -4\\end{aligned}]$ corresponds to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-\\frac{1}{2}.$ So, \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}Bu & =-\\frac{1}{2}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following picture:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14095012/assets/c0bffb825fa5610288e3c88555a41c8124cf3538b2f75ebe627543a678ca3fba.png)",
